ProtocolFeeCollector::withdrawLiquidationFees
├── given PAUSE_TYPE is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
└── given PAUSE_TYPE is not paused
    ├── when caller is not an authorized collateral operator
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorUnauthorized
    └── when caller is an authorized collateral operator
        ├── when markets and amounts lengths do not match
        │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorLengthMismatch
        ├── when both arrays are empty
        │   └── it should complete without emitting LiquidationFeesWithdrawn
        ├── when a market is neither an allowlisted borrow market nor mint market
        │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorInvalidSource(source)
        ├── when an allowlisted market borrow token is not DUSD
        │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorInvalidSource(source)
        ├── when an allowlisted DUSD borrow market is provided
        │   ├── it should call removeCollateral for the requested amount
        │   ├── it should set the collector as onBehalf
        │   ├── it should set the configured manual swap receiver as receiver
        │   ├── it should pass empty callback data
        │   └── it should emit LiquidationFeesWithdrawn
        ├── when an allowlisted DUSD borrow market's fee recipient has changed
        │   └── it should still withdraw existing liquidation fee collateral
        ├── when an allowlisted DUSD mint market is provided
        │   ├── it should call removeCollateral for the requested amount
        │   ├── it should set the collector as onBehalf
        │   ├── it should set the configured manual swap receiver as receiver
        │   ├── it should pass empty callback data
        │   └── it should emit LiquidationFeesWithdrawn
        ├── when multiple valid markets are provided
        │   ├── it should withdraw each requested amount in array order
        │   ├── it should always use the configured manual swap receiver
        │   └── it should emit LiquidationFeesWithdrawn once for each market
        ├── when a later market fails validation
        │   ├── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorInvalidSource(source)
        │   └── it should roll back earlier collateral withdrawals and transfers
        └── when removeCollateral reverts for a valid later market
            ├── it should propagate the revert
            └── it should roll back earlier collateral withdrawals and transfers
